  "details": "Presently, joining a full instance loads you into a new empty instance of that world. \nEvery moment spent in loading screens/menus is negative user experience. Waiting in lines can be fun when there are people around to share the experience with.\nPlease consider changing this mechanic so that instead of joining a new instance, you're added to a joint queueing instance, with some form of backend to be able to add/invite users to a near-full instance when able.",
